<title>SOUTH KOREA: Daewoo wins $110 mln shipbilding orders.</title>
<headline>Daewoo wins $110 mln shipbilding orders.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Daewoo Heavy Industries Ltd said on Tuesday it had won $110 million worth of orders to build two crude carriers from Nordstrom &amp; Thulin AB of Sweden.</p>
<p>Daewoo Heavy, a shipbuilding affiliate of the Daewoo Group, said it would deliver the 158,000-gross ton very large crude carriers (VLCCs) by September 1999.</p>
<p>Daewoo said its VLCC orders received so far this year amounted to one million gross tons, valued at $660 million.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5647</p>
</text>
